# Example rules file for icon-quantize: copy, edit and use with
#   icon-quantize --inplace --rules my_setup.rules out/
# Entries override the built-in "icon" preset; names are case-insensitive.
#
#   dec N   absolute error <= 0.5*10**-N (in the variable's units)
#   sig N   N significant digits at any magnitude
#   exact   never rounded

# tighter vertical velocity for LES turbulence statistics
w            dec 4      # 0.1 mm/s

# ICON-ART style tracers spanning many orders of magnitude
# tracer_01  sig 4
# tracer_02  sig 4

# masks and flags must never change
# lsm        exact
